@* 진행자가 설정하는 동안 팀장·관전자가 보는 대기 화면. *@

<div class="waiting">
    <div class="card waiting-head">
        <div class="pulse-dot"></div>
        <div>
            <h2>진행자가 준비 중입니다</h2>
            <p class="muted">시작하면 이 화면이 자동으로 드래프트 보드로 바뀝니다. 새로고침하지 않아도 됩니다.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="waiting-grid">
        <section class="card">
            <h3>규칙</h3>
            <dl class="rule-list">
                <dt>지명 순서</dt>
                <dd>@Room.OrderMode.Label() (@Room.OrderMode.Pattern())</dd>

                <dt>라운드</dt>
                <dd>@Room.Rounds 라운드 · 팀당 @(Room.Rounds)명</dd>

                <dt>턴 제한시간</dt>
                <dd>@(Room.TurnSeconds > 0 ? $"{Room.TurnSeconds}초" : "무제한")</dd>

                <dt>시간 초과</dt>
                <dd>@(Room.TurnSeconds == 0 ? "해당 없음" : Room.AutoPickOnTimeout ? "자동 지명" : "진행자 대기")</dd>
            </dl>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h3>참가 팀 <span class="count">@Room.Teams.Count</span></h3>
            @if (Room.Teams.Count == 0)
            {
                <p class="muted">아직 팀이 없습니다.</p>
            }
            else
            {
                <ol class="team-list">
                    @foreach (var team in Room.Teams)
                    {
                        <li class="team-list-item @(team.Id == MyTeamId ? "mine" : "")" style="--team-color:@team.Color">
                            <SeatLight Connected="Room.IsTeamConnected(team.Id)" />
                            <span class="team-dot"></span>
                            <span class="team-name">@team.Name</span>
                            <span class="team-captain">@team.Captain</span>
                            @if (team.Id == MyTeamId)
                            {
                                <span class="badge badge-live">내 팀</span>
                            }
                        </li>
                    }
                </ol>
            }
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h3>선수 풀 <span class="count">@Room.Players.Count</span></h3>
            @if (Room.Players.Count == 0)
            {
                <p class="muted">아직 등록된 선수가 없습니다.</p>
            }
            else
            {
                <div class="chip-wrap">
                    @foreach (var player in Room.Players)
                    {
                        <span class="chip">
                            @player.Name
                            @if (player.Position != Positions.Unset)
                            {
                                <small>@player.Position</small>
                            }
                        </span>

                    }
                </div>
            }
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public required DraftRoom Room { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public Guid? MyTeamId { get; set; }
}
